---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Case Studies | AuditVerse AI"
  description="Real client transformations — see how AuditVerse AI delivered automation, audit and ERP results."
  canonical="https://www.auditverseai.com/case-studies"
  activePage="case-studies"
>

<section class="page-hero on-dark">
  <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div class="eyebrow">Case Studies</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,54px);font-weight:800;max-width:820px;line-height:1.1;">Real transformations for real clients across Pakistan</h1>
    <p class="lede">Every engagement is reported against clear before-and-after metrics — not vague claims of 'improved efficiency.'</p>
    <div class="badge-row" style="margin-top:26px;"><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Madina Group</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>92 News</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Sayyed Engineers</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Brain Telecom</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Kashmir Sugar Mills</span></div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="tabs-nav"><button class="filter-btn tab-btn active" data-filter="all">All</button><button class="filter-btn tab-btn " data-filter="finance">Finance</button><button class="filter-btn tab-btn " data-filter="erp">ERP</button><button class="filter-btn tab-btn " data-filter="audit">Audit</button><button class="filter-btn tab-btn " data-filter="bi">BI Dashboards</button></div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <div class="case-card filterable reveal" data-cat="finance">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Madina Group case study" loading="lazy">
        <div class="content">
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gold-500);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">Madina Group</div>
          <h4 style="margin-bottom:12px;">Automated Invoice-to-Pay Across the Group</h4>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;">Madina Group (Madina Private Limited) automated 3-way invoice matching and vendor payment approvals across its business units, replacing a fully manual, paper-heavy process.</p>
          <ul class="list-check" style="gap:8px;">
            <li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> 80% faster invoice processing</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Duplicate and erroneous payments virtually eliminated</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Finance staff redeployed from data entry to vendor management</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-card filterable reveal" data-cat="bi">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Galaxy Broadcasting · 92 News case study" loading="lazy">
        <div class="content">
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gold-500);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">Galaxy Broadcasting · 92 News</div>
          <h4 style="margin-bottom:12px;">Real-Time Financial Dashboards for a Media House</h4>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;">Galaxy Broadcasting, operator of 92 News, replaced weekly manual finance reports with live Power BI dashboards covering revenue, production costs and cash position.</p>
          <ul class="list-check" style="gap:8px;">
            <li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Leadership sees cash and revenue position in real time</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Monthly reporting prep time cut from days to hours</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Department-level budget variance now tracked automatically</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-card filterable reveal" data-cat="erp">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1541976590-713941681591?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Sayyed Engineers case study" loading="lazy">
        <div class="content">
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gold-500);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">Sayyed Engineers</div>
          <h4 style="margin-bottom:12px;">Project Costing Automation for an Engineering Firm</h4>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;">Sayyed Engineers automated project-level costing and subcontractor payment tracking, giving management visibility into project margins as work progressed rather than after completion.</p>
          <ul class="list-check" style="gap:8px;">
            <li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Project margin visibility available mid-project, not at close-out</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Subcontractor payment cycle time reduced significantly</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Consolidated reporting across concurrent projects</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-card filterable reveal" data-cat="finance">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573497620053-ea5300f94f21?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Brain Telecommunications Pvt Limited case study" loading="lazy">
        <div class="content">
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gold-500);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">Brain Telecommunications Pvt Limited</div>
          <h4 style="margin-bottom:12px;">Payroll &amp; HR Workflow Automation</h4>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;">Brain Telecommunications automated payroll processing, attendance reconciliation and statutory filings across its workforce, removing manual payroll calculation errors.</p>
          <ul class="list-check" style="gap:8px;">
            <li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> 65% reduction in manual HR and payroll work</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Payroll cycle shortened with zero statutory filing delays</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Attendance and leave data now flows directly into payroll</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-card filterable reveal" data-cat="audit">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1565608087341-404b25492fee?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Faisalabad Oil Refinery case study" loading="lazy">
        <div class="content">
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gold-500);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">Faisalabad Oil Refinery</div>
          <h4 style="margin-bottom:12px;">Continuous Monitoring for a Manufacturing Operation</h4>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;">Faisalabad Oil Refinery deployed continuous AI-powered transaction monitoring across procurement and inventory, replacing periodic manual sampling with always-on control checks.</p>
          <ul class="list-check" style="gap:8px;">
            <li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Full transaction coverage versus a small manual sample</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Control gaps identified and closed mid-year</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Procurement approval cycle significantly faster</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="case-card filterable reveal" data-cat="erp">
        <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587293852726-70cdb56c2866?q=80&w=900&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="Kashmir Sugar Mills case study" loading="lazy">
        <div class="content">
          <div class="mono" style="font-size:11.5px;color:var(--gold-500);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px;">Kashmir Sugar Mills</div>
          <h4 style="margin-bottom:12px;">ERP Automation for Seasonal Production Accounting</h4>
          <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--ink-dim);line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:16px;">Kashmir Sugar Mills implemented automated production costing and inventory reconciliation to handle the sharp seasonal swings typical of sugar milling operations.</p>
          <ul class="list-check" style="gap:8px;">
            <li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Inventory reconciliation automated across crushing season</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Faster, more accurate cost-per-tonne reporting</li><li style="font-size:13.5px;"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Reduced manual reconciliation workload during peak season</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-tight on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2 class="headline center" style="max-width:640px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Want results like these for your business?</h2>
      <p class="lede center" style="margin-top:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Book a free consultation — we'll show you a realistic before-and-after based on your current processes.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions center" style="justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Book Free Consultation <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Schedule Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
